&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for bright graduates with a passion for software and a curiosity for how things work and how technology can help us solve problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will join our embedded software team and contribute to the development of innovative technologies for healthcare devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Candidates can start between May–October 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;There is no deadline for this role, as we recruit on a rolling basis. Once the position is filled, we will close the advert. We encourage you to &lt;strong&gt;apply as soon as possible&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Each project we undertake is different, and at the cutting edge of technology. This means we can&#39;t talk about much of our ongoing work, but here are some examples of completed projects that we are excited to share:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/case-studies/uk-government-ventilator-challenge&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;An emergency-use ventilator, developed in just over six weeks in response to the government’s Ventilator Challenge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/press-releases/device-treating-gait-deficit-caused-multiple-sclerosis-receives-fda-marketing&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;A neurostimulation device allowing treatment to improve, or even restore, someone’s ability to walk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/case-studies/universal-autoinjector-platform&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;An autoinjector capable of delivering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/case-studies/universal-autoinjector-platform&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt; a wide range of drugs, while being intuitive to use and beautiful to look at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;From day one, you’ll be part of our multidisciplinary medical development team, tackling real technical problems while receiving guidance and training from experienced engineers. You’ll gain access to designing and developing embedded software to a high standard. You will be part of a team developing&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;technologies that can make a meaningful difference to people’s lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Within your role you&#39;ll likely:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and test embedded software for complex medical systems used in diagnostic, surgical, implantable device, and drug-delivery applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a wide range of projects that span the full software development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a multidisciplinary and supportive team, gaining exposure to systems involving electronics, optics, fluidics, robotics, and user-interface components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with industry best practices such as continuous integration, automated testing and analysis, and model-based systems engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;To apply for this role you must:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be currently completing or have recent completed a degree in a relevant field such as Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, or Physics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience programming in C.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The most important technical skill for this role is &lt;strong&gt;programming in C&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The following skills and experience are advantageous:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with other languages such as Rust, Python or C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a team using version control (ideally Git) and peer code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to open-source software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unit testing or other verification techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing embedded software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electronics and controlling peripherals using interfaces such as UART/I2C/SPI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Signal processing and/or control theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data science and/or AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Knowledge of biology or medical subjects is not a requirement, though you should be enthusiastic about applying your technical skills to this field of application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Your CV should include all your A Level (or equivalent) subjects and grades, where applicable, as well as university modules, coursework, projects or other experience that demonstrates your relevant skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A covering statement is welcome but is not required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

